---
// 趨勢入口頁（hi-fi）：大字母＋標題＋花 → 導言 → 年度重點 → 延伸閱讀 → 下一趨勢 → footer。
// 一支 dynamic route 渲染六個趨勢。內容部分（標語/年度重點/文章）先用佔位，待 PO 補實。
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { trends } from '../../data/trends.js';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return trends.map((t) => ({ params: { id: t.id }, props: { trend: t } }));
}

const { trend } = Astro.props;

// 延伸閱讀 sample（待 PO 補實際文章）
const articleSamples = [
  '為什麼今年的保養，開始講求「由內而外」？',
  '編輯實測：這個趨勢值得入手的三個理由',
  '達人觀點：保養的下一步，正往哪裡走',
  '一張表看懂本趨勢的關鍵成分',
  '從產品到習慣，趨勢如何走進日常',
  '專家解析：這股趨勢背後的觀察',
];
const articles = articleSamples.map((title) => ({ title, author: '編輯部', date: '2026/06/30' }));
---

<BaseLayout title={`${trend.zhName} ${trend.key} · 女人我最大賞 2026`}>
  <Header pinned />

  <!-- 趨勢入口：左大字母＋標題、右花 -->
  <section class="bg-bg-surface pt-24 md:pt-28">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-frame px-6 py-12 md:px-9 md:py-16">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs tracking-[3px] text-ink-tertiary">UNFURL · 六大趨勢</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-3xl leading-tight tracking-[2px] text-heading md:text-[52px]">
            {trend.zhName}
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-2 font-serif text-xl italic text-ink-secondary md:text-2xl">{trend.key}</p>
        </div>

        {trend.cutout && (
          <figure class="mx-auto w-[200px] md:mx-0 md:ml-auto md:w-[300px]">
            <img src={trend.cutout} alt={trend.zhName} class="h-auto w-full" />
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-center font-serif text-2xl italic text-ink-tertiary">
              {trend.letter}
            </figcaption>
          </figure>
        )}
      </div>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-readable text-center font-serif text-xl italic leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary md:mt-12 md:text-2xl">
        {trend.tagline}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 導言（H2 小標 + 內文段落） -->
  <section class="px-6 md:px-9">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-readable py-14 md:py-20">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl leading-snug text-heading md:text-[32px]">{trend.subhead}</h2>
      <p class="mt-7 text-lg leading-relaxed text-heading md:text-xl">{trend.body}</p>
      {trend.intro?.map((para) => <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-loose text-ink-body">{para}</p>)}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 年度重點（編輯與達人精選） -->
  <section class="px-6 md:px-9">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-frame pb-14 md:pb-20">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl leading-snug text-heading md:text-3xl">年度重點</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-xs tracking-[2px] text-primary">編輯與達人精選</p>
      <a
        href={`/trends/${trend.id}/article`}
        class="group mt-5 flex flex-col gap-6 rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-line bg-bg-card p-6 transition-colors hover:border-ink/30 md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-10 md:p-8"
        data-track="cta_featured"
      >
        <div class="flex aspect-[4/3] w-full shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-sm bg-bg-product md:w-[360px]">
          <i class="ti ti-photo text-3xl text-ink-tertiary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="rounded-full bg-bg-surface px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-primary">編輯精選</span>
            <span class="rounded-full bg-primary px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white">含 10 大產品盤點</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mt-4 font-serif text-2xl leading-snug text-heading md:text-[28px]">
            2026 {trend.zhName}：年度 10 大品項
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-[520px] text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-body">
            {trend.featuredDesc}
          </p>
          <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-base text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-primary">
            閱讀完整盤點
            <i class="ti ti-arrow-right transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 延伸閱讀 -->
  <section class="px-6 md:px-9">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-frame pb-16 md:pb-24">
      <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-line pb-3">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl leading-snug text-heading md:text-3xl">延伸閱讀</h2>
        <p class="text-xs tracking-[2px] text-ink-tertiary">精選 3 篇</p>
      </div>
      <!-- Aesop 推薦閱讀風：上圖（3:2）下字，3 欄、寬 gap -->
      <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 md:mt-10 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-x-10">
        {
          articles.slice(0, 3).map((a) => (
            <a href="#" class="group" data-track="cta_article">
              <div class="flex aspect-[3/2] w-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-bg-product">
                <i class="ti ti-photo text-3xl text-ink-tertiary" aria-hidden="true" />
              </div>
              <p class="mt-4 text-base font-medium leading-snug text-heading transition-colors group-hover:text-primary md:text-lg">
                {a.title}
              </p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink-tertiary">{a.author} · {a.date}</p>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 看更多趨勢（取代下一趨勢 banner）：其他五大趨勢中文大字＋英文，點擊直達該趨勢頁 -->
  <section class="border-t border-line bg-bg-surface px-6 md:px-9">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-frame py-16 md:py-24">
      <p class="text-xs tracking-[3px] text-ink-tertiary">UNFURL · 看更多趨勢</p>
      <div class="mt-6 md:mt-8">
        {
          trends
            .filter((t) => t.id !== trend.id)
            .map((t) => (
              <a
                href={`/trends/${t.id}`}
                class="group flex items-baseline gap-4 border-b border-line py-5 md:py-6"
                data-track="cta_more_trend"
              >
                <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl leading-none text-heading transition-colors group-hover:text-primary md:text-[44px]">
                  {t.zhName}
                </h2>
                <span class="font-serif text-lg italic text-ink-tertiary md:text-xl">{t.key}</span>
                <i
                  class="ti ti-arrow-right ml-auto self-center text-ink-tertiary transition-all group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-primary"
                  aria-hidden="true"
                />
              </a>
            ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
